<header id="top">
<div id="sceneWrap" aria-label="Scroll to see the machine arrive on site">
  <div id="sceneSticky">
    

    <div class="hero-copy" id="heroCopy">
      <p class="k">Excavator & Attachment Hire</p>
      <h1 class="h1">Machine on site,<br>job <em>done.</em></h1>
      <p class="d">Excavator hire, wet hire with operator, trenching, site cuts & clearing, rock breaking - the right machine, the right attachment, on your site when you need it.</p>
